# Lean build artifacts
lean/.lake/

# Agent worktrees: one checkout per concurrent session, inside the repository
# and untracked. Without this, `git add -A` stages another session's worktree
# as an embedded repository, which git reports in a hint rather than an error
# and which every gate here passes.
.claude/
